  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Production and processing of manioc and associated crops in Acul-du-Nord</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This amendment provides MPA an additional six months and $55,000 to conduct activities to address issues related to the COVID-19 pandemic, including by providing reliable information to stop the spread of COVID and purchasing locally-sourced protective equipment and sanitation kits, reaching 23,000 residents in the Nord and Nord-Est departments. As part of this amendment, MPA is mobilizing an additional $19,650 in counterpart resources to the grant agreement.</narrative>
  </description>
